{'symbol': 'SJM', 'date': '2022-06-23 16:35:00', 'title': 'THE J.M. SMUCKER CO. ANNOUNCES UPDATES TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS LEADERSHIP', 'text': 'ORRVILLE, OHIO , JUNE 23, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE J.M. SMUCKER CO. (NYSE: SJM) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MARK SMUCKER, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, WILL ASSUME THE EXPANDED ROLE OF CHAIR\xa0OF THE BOARD\xa0EFFECTIVE AUGUST 17, 2022.'}